          "type": "learn",
          "id": "v4-gaps-02",
          "title": "Techniques",
          "body": "A lineman's alignment is a number. 0 is head-up on the center, 1 shades the center, 2 is head-up on a guard, 3 is the guard's outside shoulder, 4 head-up on a tackle, 5 the tackle's outside shoulder. Numbers past 5 differ by system.",
          "concept": "technique"
        },
