          "id": "v4-gaps-03",
          "title": "The famous ones",
          "body": "A 3-technique lines up in the B gap and is often the best interior pass rusher. A 0- or 1-technique nose tackle plays the A gaps. A 4i sits on a tackle's inside shoulder.",
          "concept": "technique"
